# Only the source and the charts the dashboard uses are tracked.
# Everything in the chart folders is ignored, then the charts that
# '2. Australia Chair Tool.qmd' loads are added back below.

# Rendered dashboards, R session files, old material
# (except the published dashboard and the short-link page GitHub Pages serves)
*.html
!/2. Australia Chair Tool.html
!/index.html
!/theme/navigation.html
!/theme/page-guides.html
!/editions/*.html
*.pptx
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
Archive/
*_files/
.quarto/

# Local backup copies of scripts (e.g. '1e. Energy.R.bak2')
*.bak
*.bak[0-9]

# Chart folders: ignore all contents...
Overview/**
Economy/**
Trade/**
Data centres/**
Energy/**
Migration/**
Patents/**
Tech/**
Investment/**
Minerals/**
Critical minerals/**
!Overview/
!Economy/
!Trade/
!Data centres/
!Energy/
!Migration/
!Patents/
!Tech/
!Investment/
!Critical minerals/

